  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Positive Memories and Enjoyment</h2>\n<p>The event was described as enjoyable and fun, with participants expressing enthusiasm and excitement about the experience. Many participants mentioned that they had a great time and that the event was memorable in a positive way.</p>\n<h2>Event Duration and Emotional Impact</h2>\n<p>While the event was fun, it also passed quickly, and some participants found it difficult to assess in detail due to its fast-paced nature. At the same time, the event left a strong emotional impact, with many expressing sadness at its conclusion after completing their shifts.</p>\n<h2>Legacy and Nostalgia</h2>\n<p>The event was considered legendary by some participants, and even now, it is viewed with a sense of nostalgia. Some participants found it somewhat humorous in retrospect, adding to its lasting impression.</p>\n<h2>Observations and Participation</h2>\n<p>Participants observed multiple teams taking part in the event, and there were various moments that made the experience enjoyable. Some participants mentioned that it was fun to see everything happen quickly, even if it sometimes led to unexpected incidents.</p>\n<h2>Challenges and Safety</h2>\n<p>There were instances where patients arrived at the hospital already deceased, which was a challenging part of the experience. Safety was emphasized, with participants being instructed to wear seatbelts, as not doing so could prevent them from being helped in emergencies.</p>\n<h2>Miscellaneous Observations</h2>\n<p>There were several instances of repeated &#x27;Mmm&#x27; sounds, as well as agreements expressed with &#x27;Okay.&#x27; These moments, while brief, were part of the overall experience and contributed to the atmosphere of the event.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aYFGvqTT66E</p>",
